6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,000
[OptimusPrimal]{Animation:FaceDetermined|character=OptimusPrimal}{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 报告损害：船头凹了、咖啡机坏了、我的发型还健在。

7
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:31,500
[Cheetor]{Animation:FaceHappy|character=Cheetor}{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 队长，这星球氧气充足，特别适合我这种高颜值猎手。

8
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:36,000
[OptimusPrimal]{Animation:PointForward|character=OptimusPrimal}{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 等等，探测器显示 Energon 浓度超标。再不变形，我们会变成会说话的烟花。

102
