9
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:41,000
[Megatron]{Animation:CrossArms|character=Megatron}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 飞船砸进火山口，正好省了我的烧烤炉。Waspinator，扫描当地生物。

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:46,000
[Waspinator]{Animation:LookAround|character=Waspinator}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 老大，我扫描到一只苍蝇、两只苍蝇、三只苍蝇……请问我们要变苍蝇吗？

11
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:50,000
[Megatron]{Animation:PointForward|character=Megatron}{Camera:Static|position=0,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 变苍蝇？不，给我找最凶残的！比如……隔壁那只大黄蜂。

103
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:50,100
@PrehistoricJungleScene
{Position:OptimusPrimal|x=-1.5|y=0|z=0|face=forward}
