12
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:55,000
[OptimusPrimal]{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 扫描程序启动，Cheetor，你第一个上。

13
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:59,500
[Cheetor]{Animation:LookAround|character=Cheetor}{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 我要变剑齿虎！不，变霸王龙！再不行变哥斯拉！

14
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:04,000
[OptimusPrimal]{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 系统显示你最适合猎豹，因为……你跑得快，脑子也跑得快点。

15
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:08,000
[Cheetor]{Animation:HitStagger|character=Cheetor}{Camera:Static|position=-0.5,2.2,6|lookAt=0,1.2,0} 猎豹？那我只负责可爱吗？

104
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,100
@PrehistoricJungleScene
{Position:OptimusPrimal|x=-1.8|y=0|z=1|face=Megatron}
